      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, i'm working on a paper about cross-cultural psychology and looking at how different demographics handle high-pressure workplace settings. Based on current sociological trends and common psychological observations, how would you characterize the typical temperament of individuals from East Asian backgrounds compared to those from Mediterranean or Latin backgrounds when they are in high-stress environments?",
